  "description": "In and out. A simple heist like any other for Violet. Unfortunately for her, a minor slip up results in her being held captive by head of the house, Duke Belfort. Unbeknownst to Violet, her mother ran off with the duke's treasure decades ago and now it's her turn to pay the debt her family owes. Money seems like the last thing Duke Belfort is interested in, however.\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Part of Metatoon's Sinbuncha Danpyeonseon (신분차 단편선) Collection.*",
